lationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>recordTarget.patientRole.patient.administrativeGenderCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.dateOfBirth</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>recordTarget.patientRole.patient.birthTime</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.deceased:boolean</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>recordTarget.patientRole.patient.sdtc:deceasedInd</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.deceased:dateTime</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>recordTarget.patientRole.patient.sdtc:deceasedTime</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.multipleBirth:boolean</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>recordTarget.patientRole.patient.sdtc:multipleBirthInd</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.multipleBirth:integer</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>recordTarget.patientRole.patient.sdtc:multipleBirthOrderNumber</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.birthPlace</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>recordTarget.patientRole.patient.birthPlace</td><td>FRLMPatient.birthPlace est une Address simple ; nom du lieu, adresse et code officiel géographique sont portés par les composantes standard de cette adresse (text, line, city, country, etc.).</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.contact</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td