ble class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient (Information about an individual or animal receiving health care services)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.identifier (An identifier for this patient | Identifiant patient. Pour modéliser un patient avec une INS validée, il est nécessaire de respecter la conformité au profil FrCorePatientINS. Les identifiants NIR et NIA ne sont définis uniquement dans le cas du FRCorePatientINS.)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.address</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.address (An address expressed using postal conventions (as opposed to GPS or other location definition formats))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.telecom</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.telecom (Details of a Technology mediated contact point (phone, fax, email, etc.))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.name:officialName</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.name:officialName (Name of a human | Nom de naissance)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.name:usualName</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.name:usualName (Name of a human | Nom utilisé)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.name:officialName.family</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.name:officialName.family (Family name (often called 'Surname'))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.name:usualName.family</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.name:usualName.family (Family name (often called 'Surname'))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.name:officialName.given</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.name:officialName.given (Dans le cas d’une identité créée ou modifiée par un appel au téléservice INSi, il est nécessaire d’extraire le premier prénom de la liste des prénoms retournée par le téléservice et de l'inclure dans le champs given. En cas de prénom composé, given peut par exemple contenir 'Anne-sophie' ou 'Anne Sophie'.)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.name:usualName.given</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.name:usualName.given (Given names (not always 'first'). Includes middle names)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.name:officialName.use</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.name:officialName.use (usual | official | temp | nickname | anonymous | old | maiden)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.name:usualName.use</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.name:usualName.use (usual | official | temp | nickname | anonymous | old | maiden)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.administrativeGender</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.gender (male | female | unknown)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.dateOfBirth</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.birthDate (The date of birth for the french patient checked with the INSitelservice | Date de naissance du patient. Dans le cas d'une identité récupérée du téléservice INSi, la date de naissance est modifiée selon les règles du RNIV dans le cas de dates exceptionnelles.)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.deceased:boolean</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.deceased[x] (Indicates if the individual is deceased or not)</td><td>Valeur booléenne de deceased[x].</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.deceased:dateTime</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.deceased[x] (Indicates if the individual is deceased or not)</td><td>Valeur dateTime de deceased[x].</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.multipleBirth:boolean</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.multipleBirth[x] (Whether patient is part of a multiple birth)</td><td>Valeur booléenne de multipleBirth[x].</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.multipleBirth:integer</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Patient.multipleBirth[x] (Whether patient is part of a multiple birth)</td><td>Valeur integer de multipleBirth[x].</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPatient.birthPlace</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" 